  "bodyHash": "qaFWFXBjp2E=",
  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.serveratelier.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.serveratelier.com/assets/themes/atelier/assets/images/banner/sa_budget.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"6664\" height=\"917\"></a></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/zuOfip3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/cV4cJyGXqF\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/745451299713056791?color=7289DA&amp;label=DISCORD&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"202\" height=\"28\"> </a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fglobox1997.github.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fAdventureZ%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/website?color=7bc466&amp;label=Globox&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;up_message=Wiki&amp;url=https://globox1997.github.io/wiki/mods/AdventureZ/\" width=\"132\" height=\"28\"></a> <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Globox1997/AdventureZ?color=c4667b&amp;style=for-the-badge\" width=\"152\" height=\"28\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/K0Bn3Mh.png\" width=\"200\" height=\"27\"></p><p>&nbsp;本模组为《我的世界》添加了一个新的末地Boss以及其他致命生物。这个Boss名为\"黑石傀儡\"，将是你遇到过的最强敌人。如果你开始与猪灵开战，要小心，它们会召唤它们的野兽来帮忙！你甚至可能被通常在灵魂沙河谷出现的灵魂收割者抓住。差点忘了提：有人见过一种长相怪异的小生物在四处爬行……</p><p>通过添加&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/voidz\" rel=\"nofollow\">VoidZ</a>&nbsp;模组，可以启用另一个末地Boss战。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/orHp7EY.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"30\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>黑石傀儡</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/bKGZ5uZ.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1029\" height=\"876\"></strong></p>\n<p><em>- 通过仪式生成<br><br></em></p>\n<p><strong>猪灵野兽</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/LPYvmK3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"949\" height=\"846\"></strong></p>\n<p><em>- 在攻击猪灵或挖掘下界金矿石时随机生成<br><br></em></p>\n<p><strong>灵魂收割者（坐骑：梦魇）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/3e1dggC.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"546\" height=\"436\"></strong></p>\n<p><em>- 在灵魂沙河谷生成</em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>死灵法师</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/ruY6B5g.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"674\" height=\"711\"></strong></p>\n<p><em>- 在下界要塞生成<br><br></em></p>\n<p><strong>召唤师（及其守卫）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5f6Xge9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"974\" height=\"681\"></strong></p>\n<p><strong>- 在雷暴期间生成<br><br></strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong>烈焰守卫</strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m5yqLAk.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1020\" height=\"815\"></strong></strong><em><strong>- 在下界要塞生成</strong></em></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><em><strong><strong>龙</strong></strong></em><em><strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/nXwoNRW.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1114\" height=\"626\"></strong></strong></em></p>\n<p>你必须击败\"眼\"来夺回龙蛋。</p>\n<p>龙蛋会感知到你击败\"眼\"所获得的声望，并会随时间孵化（约10分钟）。</p>\n<p>龙孵化后，通过喂食生肉或兽人皮来驯服它。</p>\n<p>龙需要成长一个阶段才能被骑乘（需要龙鞍），再成长一个阶段才能携带箱子。</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C8KMb7U.png\" width=\"300\" height=\"28\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><strong>石傀儡生成方法</strong>&nbsp;<br>通过与猪灵以物易物或在下界堡垒中找到4个镶金黑石碎片。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/SxJGrG3.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1123\" height=\"577\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>将雕纹磨制黑石放入切石机，制作4个雕纹磨制黑石基座。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/qwoOGqs.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"512\" height=\"271\"></p>\n<p>用黑石块（或任何类似黑石的方块）建造一个半径为5的圆形区域，并在每个边缘放置一个石基座，如下图所示：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/dI4JfCX.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"791\" height=\"784\"></p>\n<p>将4个碎片全部放入基座后，仪式就会开始……</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>\"眼\"的生成方法<br></strong>建造这个祭坛并稍等片刻。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/m72h6jq.png\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WYvGcDs.png\" width=\"100\" height=\"29\"></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p>- 手册（需要&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli模组</a>）</p>\n<p>- 黑石傀儡掉落物：黑石之心、镶金碎片、下界合金、黑石</p>\n<p>- 灵魂收割者掉落物：凋灵骷髅头、煤炭</p>\n<p>- 猪灵野兽掉落物：金锭、猪灵旗帜</p>\n<p>- 死灵法师掉落物：附魔书</p>\n<p>- 召唤师掉落物：附魔书（可能在下个更新中添加：召唤法杖）</p>\n<p>- 梦魇可被驯服</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>猪灵旗帜</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/KXHFC5h.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1111\" height=\"676\">猪灵旗帜需要充能，充能后当你靠近时，所有敌对猪灵会变得平静。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>镶金下界合金盔甲</strong><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yvzACI4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"721\" height=\"721\"></strong><strong>这是下界合金盔甲的强化版本，且猪灵不会攻击你！（并有全套效果）</strong></p>\n<p><strong><br><strong>手册</strong></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/eKg4yfH.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"880\" height=\"361\"></strong></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><p>重要的事实：</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://globox1997.github.io/youareloved_red.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/WKCuHQL.png\" width=\"80\" height=\"34\"></p><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fabric-api\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ol1Tcf8.png\" alt=\"fabric-api\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/cloth-config\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/7weZ8uu.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"125\" height=\"42\"></a></p><p>本模组为Fabric开发。</p><p>暂无开发Forge版本的计划。&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>整合包使用许可：<strong><br></strong></p><p>欢迎在任何整合包中使用本模组。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>漏洞报告：</p><p>请在GitHub页面报告漏洞。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>许可协议：</p><p>音效授权于&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252faudiojungle.net%252flicenses%252fterms%252faudio_sfx_media_single\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://audiojungle.net/licenses/terms/audio_sfx_media_single</a> 或修改自原版《我的世界》音效。</p><p>如需游戏内维基手册，请安装&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/patchouli-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patchouli模组</a> &nbsp;并在创造模式物品栏中查找AdventureZ手册。</p>",
